'''Quadrant C''' was a quadrant of the [[Trantor-class supertanker fuel depot|supertanker fuel depot]] ''[[Colossus]]''.<ref name="A Quick Salvage Run" /> In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{ResistanceDate|2|2}}</ref> the [[Resurgent-class Star Destroyer|''Resurgent''-class Star Destroyer]]<ref name="A Quick Salvage Run" /> ''[[Thunderer]]''<ref name="Battles">''[[Star Wars: Battles that Changed the Galaxy]]''</ref> [[Skirmish over D'Qar|attacked]] the ''Colossus'' above<ref name="A Quick Salvage Run" /> the [[planet]]<ref name="Battles" /> [[D'Qar]]. When the [[Space station|station's]] [[deflector shield]]s gave out, the [[Command bridge droid|droid]] [[4D-M1N]] reported to [[Captain]] [[Imanuel Doza]] that quadrant C had taken on [[hull]] damage, which would result in a breach if they did not jump to [[hyperspace]] soon. However, the ''Colossus'' managed to flee the skirmish moments afterward and escape destruction.<ref name="A Quick Salvage Run" />

==Behind the scenes==
Quadrant C was mentioned in "[[A Quick Salvage Run]],"<ref name="A Quick Salvage Run" /> the second episode of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season Two|second season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'', which aired on [[October 3]], [[2019]].<ref name="Disney release">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref>

